# 统一行尾：源码与脚本一律 LF，避免 CRLF 造成整文件级假 diff。
# 本仓库所有 Python 源码、Shell 脚本、配置样例、Markdown 文档均使用 LF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.so binary
*.pt binary
*.bin binary
*.safetensors binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.db binary

# 明确源码与脚本类型。
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.env text eol=lf
*.env.example text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.cfg text eol=lf
*.ini text eol=lf
